        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>资金同业业务</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    html,body{margin:0;background:#fff}\n    body{font-family:\"Noto Serif SC\",\"Songti SC\",\"STSong\",serif;color:#4d4d4d}\n    .page{\n      width:1489px;height:2112px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;\n      padding:346px 106px 52px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .top-title{\n      color:#007b42;font-family:\"Noto Sans SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n      font-size:24px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 7px;\n    }\n    .intro{\n      margin:0;font-size:23px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.6px;\n      white-space:nowrap;\n    }\n    .tab{\n      position:absolute;right:0;top:454px;width:77px;height:376px;\n      background:#fc5b12;color:#fff;border-radius:26px 0 0 26px;\n      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n      font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;\n      writing-mode:vertical-rl;letter-spacing:3px;\n      transform:skewY(-4deg);\n    }\n    .business{margin-top:57px}\n    .biz-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:350px 1fr;column-gap:34px}\n    .biz-row + .biz-row{margin-top:26px}\n    .icon-area{\n      height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n      gap:24px;color:#fa5b13;\n    }\n    .vert-label{\n      writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n      font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;line-height:1;color:#fa5b13;\n    }\n    .placeholder{\n      width:122px;height:122px;border:0;color:#fa5b13;\n      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n      font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;\n    }\n    .finance-icon{\n      width:105px;height:114px;position:relative;border:4px solid #fa5b13;\n      border-radius:11px;\n    }\n    .finance-icon:before{content:\"￥\";position:absolute;right:-25px;top:12px;width:40px;height:40px;border:4px solid #fa5b13;border-radius:50%;font:700 28px Arial;text-align:center;line-height:40px;background:white}\n    .finance-icon:after{content:\"↔\";position:absolute;left:11px;top:26px;font:48px Arial;color:#fa5b13;background:#fff;line-height:40px}\n    .client-icon{\n      width:82px;height:108px;border:4px solid #fa5b13;position:relative;\n    }\n    .client-icon:before{content:\"◯\";position:absolute;left:23px;top:-34px;font:73px Arial;color:#fa5b13;background:#fff;line-height:62px}\n    .client-icon:after{content:\"✓\";position:absolute;left:-23px;top:25px;border:4px solid #fa5b13;border-radius:50%;width:35px;height:35px;text-align:center;line-height:31px;font:bold 25px Arial;color:#fa5b13;background:#fff}\n    .biz-content{font-size:23px;line-height:1.62;padding-top:2px;letter-spacing:.1px}\n    .biz-content p{margin:0}\n    .rule{border:0;border-top:1px dotted #fa5b13;margin:34px 0 28px}\n    .metrics{margin-top:68px}\n    .section-title{\n      margin:0 0 35px;color:#007b42;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n      font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\n    }\n    table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed}\n    .report{font-size:22px;line-height:1.7}\n    .report col:nth-child(1){width:42%}\n    .report col:nth-child(2){width:18%}\n    .report col:nth-child(3){width:22%}\n    .report col:nth-child(4){width:18%}\n    .report thead{color:#fa5b13;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:16px}\n    .report thead tr{border-bottom:1px solid #fa5b13}\n    .report thead th{font-weight:400;padding:0 0 3px;text-align:right}\n    .report thead th:first-child{text-align:left}\n    .report thead .current{font-weight:700}\n    .report td{padding:0;text-align:right;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap}\n    .report td:first-child{text-align:left}\n    .report .strong{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#292727}\n    .group td{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:#292727;padding-top:8px}\n    .sub td:first-child{padding-left:23px}\n    .sub2 td:first-child{padding-left:91px}\n    .divider td{border-bottom:1px solid #fa5b13;padding-bottom:1px}\n    .second{margin-top:31px}\n    .notes{font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;margin-top:4px;color:#555}\n    .notes div{padding-left:35px;text-indent:-35px}\n    .footer{\n      position:absolute;left:110px;right:52px;bottom:40px;\n      display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;font-size:16px;color:#666;\n    }\n    .footer .year{color:#fa5b13;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:17px}\n    .footer .pageno{font-size:27px;margin-left:16px;color:#333}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1 class=\"top-title\">资金同业业务</h1>\n    <p class=\"intro\">平安银行资金同业业务通过“投资交易+客户业务”双轮驱动，持续提升投资、交易和销售三大能力，助力金融市场高质量发展。</p>\n\n    <aside class=\"tab\">经营回顾及业务分析</aside>\n\n    <section class=\"business\">\n      <div class=\"biz-row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-area\">\n          <span class=\"vert-label\">投资交易</span>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\"><div class=\"finance-icon\" aria-label=\"[投资交易图标]\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"biz-content\">\n          <p>平安银行加强宏观分析研判，在保障资产端的流动性与安全性前提下，优化交易策略，</p>\n          <p>合理配置持仓组合，保持稳健投资。2024年，平安银行债券交易量的市场份额为4.4%，</p>\n          <p>同比上升1.2个百分点。</p>\n          <hr class=\"rule\">\n          <p>平安银行依托客户综合服务优势，在做市、避险、机构销售、托管等多领域积极发力。</p>\n          <p>2024年，平安银行境内外机构销售的现券交易量4.54万亿元，同比增长46.0%；在平安银</p>\n          <p>行办理外汇即期及衍生品避险业务的客户达14,987户，同比增长16.5%；截至2024年12</p>\n          <p>月31日，通过“行e通”平台销售的资管产品保有规模2,667.05亿元，较年初增长33.2%；</p>\n          <p>托管净值规模达9.10万亿元，较年初增长4.6%。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"biz-row\" style=\"position:absolute;top:681px;left:106px;\">\n        <div class=\"icon-area\">\n          <span class=\"vert-label\">客户业务</span>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\"><div class=\"client-icon\" aria-label=\"[客户业务图标]\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"metrics\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">银行业务关键指标</h2>\n\n      <table class=\"report\">\n        <colgroup><col><col><col><col></colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n            <th class=\"current\">2024年</th>\n            <th>2023年</th>\n            <th>变动(%)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"group\"><td colspan=\"4\">经营成果</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>营业收入</td><td class=\"strong\">146,695</td><td>164,699</td><td>（10.9）</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>净利润</td><td class=\"strong\">44,508</td><td>46,455</td><td>（4.2）</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>成本收入比(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">27.66</td><td>27.90</td><td>下降0.24个百分点</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>平均总资产收益率(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">0.78</td><td>0.85</td><td>下降0.07个百分点</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>加权平均净资产收益率(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">10.08</td><td>11.38</td><td>下降1.30个百分点</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"divider\"><td>净息差(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">1.87</td><td>2.38</td><td>下降0.51个百分点</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <table class=\"report second\">\n        <colgroup><col><col><col><col></colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n            <th class=\"current\">2024年12月31日</th>\n            <th>2023年12月31日</th>\n            <th>变动</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"group\"><td colspan=\"4\">存贷款业务<sup>(1)</sup></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>吸收存款</td><td class=\"strong\">3,533,678</td><td>3,407,295</td><td>3.7%</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"sub\"><td>其中：个人存款</td><td class=\"strong\">1,287,180</td><td>1,207,618</td><td>6.6%</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"sub2\"><td>企业存款</td><td class=\"strong\">2,246,498</td><td>2,199,677</td><td>2.1%</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>发放贷款和垫款总额</td><td class=\"strong\">3,374,103</td><td>3,407,509</td><td>（1.0%）</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"sub\"><td>其中：个人贷款</td><td class=\"strong\">1,767,168</td><td>1,977,719</td><td>（10.6%）</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"sub2 divider\"><td>企业贷款</td><td class=\"strong\">1,606,935</td><td>1,429,790</td><td>12.4%</td></tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"group\"><td colspan=\"4\">资产质量</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>不良贷款率(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">1.06</td><td>1.06</td><td>–</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>拨备覆盖率(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">250.71</td><td>277.63</td><td>下降26.92个百分点</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"divider\"><td>逾期60天以上贷款偏离度<sup>(2)</sup></td><td class=\"strong\">0.80</td><td>0.74</td><td>上升0.06</td></tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"group\"><td colspan=\"4\">资本充足率</td></tr>\n          <tr class=\"divider\"><td>核心一级资本充足率<sup>(3)</sup>(%)</td><td class=\"strong\">9.12</td><td>9.22</td><td>下降0.10个百分点</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"notes\">\n        <div>注：(1) 吸收存款、发放贷款和垫款总额及其明细项目均为不含息金额。</div>\n        <div>　　(2) 逾期60天以上贷款偏离度=逾期60天以上贷款余额／不良贷款余额。</div>\n        <div>　　(3) 核心一级资本充足率的最低监管要求为7.75%。</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span class=\"year\">二零二四年年报</span>\n      <span>中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司　<span class=\"pageno\">51</span></span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
